# Series 4

## Exercise 4.1

### A




::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
arima.sim(list(ar = c(0.8)), n = 1000)
```
:::




### B




::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
theo <- ARMAacf(ar = c(0.5, 0.2), lag.max = 100)
sim_data <- arima.sim(model = list(ar = c(0.5, 0.2)), n = 500)
plugin <- acf(sim_data, lag.max = 100, plot = FALSE)$acf

plot(0:100, theo, type = "l")
lines(0:100, plugin)
```

