## Exercise 4.3




::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
data <- read.table("../../sp26/rtp/data/ts_S3_A2.dat", header=TRUE)
```
:::




### A




::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
plot(ts(data$ts1))
abline(h=mean(data$ts1))
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](rtp02_exercise_04_files/figure-pdf/unnamed-chunk-10-1.pdf){fig-pos='H'}
:::
:::




$ts1$ seems to be stationary.




::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
plot(ts(data$ts2))
